Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1850
Set Height 1000
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 30
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 60
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set Theme "rose-pine-moon"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Output reel-manual.mp4
Output reel-manual.gif
Hide
Type "lilbee-tui"
Enter
Sleep 80s
Show
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+g
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 70s
Escape
Sleep 700ms
Type "i"
Sleep 400ms
Type "How does lilbee split a large model across multiple GPUs?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 95s
Sleep 3s
